# Generic reactions to the four social actions, used for any villager who has no lines of their own.
# The speaker * means "the villager being talked to". Villager-specific reactions are social.<villager>.<action>.<outcome>.

dialogue social.joke.great
n0 *: Ha! Oh, that's a good one. I'm going to repeat that.
  emote note

dialogue social.joke.good
n0 *: Ha, that's funny.

dialogue social.joke.meh
n0 *: Ha. Funny. Almost.

dialogue social.joke.flop
n0 *: ...Was that a joke? Oh! Ha. Give me a second.
  emote ellipsis

dialogue social.compliment.great
n0 *: Oh, you're too kind. That honestly made my day.
  emote heart

dialogue social.compliment.good
n0 *: That's kind of you to say.

dialogue social.compliment.meh
n0 *: Oh. Thank you.

dialogue social.compliment.flop
n0 *: Oh. Er... thank you. That was unexpected.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.advice.great
n0 *: You want my advice? Gladly. Take your time, and trust your gut.

dialogue social.advice.good
n0 *: My advice? Slow down and enjoy it.

dialogue social.advice.meh
n0 *: My advice? Drink some water.

dialogue social.advice.flop
n0 *: Advice? Oh. I'm the wrong person to ask. Truly.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.tease.great
n0 *: Ha! Oh, you're cheeky. I like it.
  emote sparkle

dialogue social.tease.good
n0 *: Cheeky. Fair enough.

dialogue social.tease.meh
n0 *: Funny. Careful, now.

dialogue social.tease.flop
n0 *: Hm. I'll pretend I didn't hear that.
  emote ellipsis
